= Yuchen Jiao

~~~
{}{img_left}{yjiao.png}{alt text}{}{240}
I am an Research Associate in the Department of Statistics and Data Science at the Chinese University of Hong Kong, advised by Professor Gen Li.\n

Previously, I received my Ph.D. in the Department of Electronic Engineering at Tsinghua University, advised by Professor Yuantao Gu. Before my Ph.D., I received my bachelor's degree from the Department of Electronic Engineering at Tsinghua University in 2014. \n
\n
I am interested in diffusion based generative models, reinforcement learning, transformers, and signal processing. \n
\n
